# {{ theme_name }} — generated by theme-set, do not edit
# A catppuccin/tmux flavor ("current"). theme-set.py copies it into the
# plugin's themes folder and re-sources ~/.tmux.conf, so the plugin rebuilds
# its status styles (which it bakes in with set -F) from these colors.
# Plain `set -g` (the stock flavors use -o, "only if unset"): the plugin only
# clears the old colors with @catppuccin_reset, so -o would keep them forever.
